 dresses for less. I had a great experience with TJ formal. I saved $100 on a BM dress. Now I am shopping for my friend&#039;s wedding dress for less. \n \n If you have used one of these companies, post what you thought &amp;amp; I&#039;ll update the first post.\n \n Lee Philip &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.leephilipbridals.com\/\"&gt;Page Title&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Netbride &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.netbride.com\/\"&gt;Netbride - discount bridal gowns, wedding gowns, bridesmaid dresses&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Perfect bridal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.perfectbridal.com\/\"&gt;Wedding Dresses at Discount Prices&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Best bridal prices &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\/\"&gt;Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Bridal elegance &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bridalelegance-eriepa.com\/\"&gt;Bridal Elegance&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n RK bridal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/rkbridal.com\/localpages\/new_page_1.htm\"&gt;New Page 1&lt;\/a&gt;\n toll-free: 800-929-9512 \n \n Chrissy Os &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.chrissyobridal.com\/index.htm\"&gt;Welcome to Chrissy O Fashion and Bridal Boutique!&lt;\/a&gt;\n Recommended by a knottie\n \n TJ formal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tjformal.com\/\"&gt;2008 Prom Dresses - Wedding Dresses - Bridemaids - Mother of the Bride Gowns&lt;\/a&gt; (google for a 10% off coupon)\n Recommended by Tami (foxytv) &amp;amp; Morgan","Attachments":[],"Id":307850,"PostDate":1211158451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n            