> Time: 1453293252 / Wed, 20 Jan 2016 12:34:12 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79877&SessionId=454a15955968908fda426e3715dbdbde
> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.65.106.3","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79877,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3931c2fc87865d99a6782d11a148024","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Initially we were getting married October 17, 2017 at the Grand Palladium, Riviera Maya. &amp;nbsp;I spent months researching and we had finally picked everything we wanted and I e-mailed the resort to book. &amp;nbsp;Well, the resort had changed some reception options for 2017 and our 75-100 person wedding was going to end up costing us $5,000 more than it would in 2016 OR we could not have our reception on the beach. &amp;nbsp;We&#039;re going to Mexico to get married we want the reception to be on the beach or at the very least overlooking the ocean.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We visited the Grand Palladium in the past and loved it which is why we picked the resort. &amp;nbsp;Now I&#039;m at a loss. &amp;nbsp;Where do we go? &amp;nbsp;Recommendations please!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909721,"PostDate":1453212501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Initially we were getting married October 17, 2017 at the Grand Palladium, Riviera Maya. \u00a0I spent months researching and we had finally picked everything we wanted and I e-mailed the resort to book. \u00a0Well, the resort had changed some reception options for 2017 and our 75-100 person wedding was going to end up costing us $5,000 more than it would in 2016 OR we could not have our reception on the beach. \u00a0We're going to Mexico to get married we want the reception to be on the beach or at the very least overlooking the ocean.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We visited the Grand Palladium in the past and loved it which is why we picked the resort. \u00a0Now I'm at a loss. \u00a0Where do we go? \u00a0Recommendations please!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreapurcell1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.174.154.76","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428247257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282640.png?_r=1433807300","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"andreapurcell1","Id":282640,"Name":"andreapurcell1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79877,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1453213739,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"237ac5febcf9a3da0166d2b9fb084b46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"andreapurcell1\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had my wedding at Beach Palace and I would recommend it to anyone. You have a lot of guests so you would definitely qualify for all of the unlimited private events and that&#039;s a really big perk to have because it saves you a lot. We had our ceremony and our reception on the Sky Terrace\/Sky Deck (the rooftop of the resort) and it overlooks the ocean. Originally I wanted to have our ceremony on the beach, but once we discovered this option we actually loved it a lot more. It was such a nice spot for our party at night.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909724,"PostDate":1453213719,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282640\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282640-andreapurcell1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">andreapurcell1<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I had my wedding at Beach Palace and I would recommend it to anyone. You have a lot of guests so you would definitely qualify for all of the unlimited private events and that's a really big perk to have because it saves you a lot. We had our ceremony and our reception on the Sky Terrace\/Sky Deck (the rooftop of the resort) and it overlooks the ocean. Originally I wanted to have our ceremony on the beach, but once we discovered this option we actually loved it a lot more. It was such a nice spot for our party at night.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79877,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46dd1d2017026c6ab2e1737b0ce51e0b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"andreapurcell1\"] I second&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"perianjay\"], beach palace has a beautiful rooftop 360 vies of both beach the lagoon. The beach is just so amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please follow link of a wedding we did at Beachpalacecancun in 2015, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are you working with a travel agent? if not I would definitely bring one in.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909725,"PostDate":1453215239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282640\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282640-andreapurcell1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">andreapurcell1<\/span><\/a> I second\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a>, beach palace has a beautiful rooftop 360 vies of both beach the lagoon. The beach is just so amazing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please follow link of a wedding we did at Beachpalacecancun in 2015, <a href='https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2015\/11\/14\/mahsa-and-kiarash-beach-palace-cancun-resort-cancun-destination-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/dreamwedding...nation-wedding\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you working with a travel agent? if not I would definitely bring one in.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
