{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.190.39","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1453046161,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04846487a6ba2873d21bc679df2778ee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m selling my Watters Gown (2015 design) which retails for $2000+ tax\n\n\nI have had the dress professionally cleaned by a dry cleaner ($400) and the dress is in great condition (no tears or rips etc)\n\n\nIt&#039;s a size 12 (Street size 10) and has had no alterations at all.\n\n\nAsking $1200 obo\n\n\nLocated in Toronto, but willing to ship if you pay for the shipping costs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;**flowers removed from the back of the dress, but I did keep them in case someone would want them added back on**&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/watters.com\/Product\/WtooBrides\/14430\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/watters.com\/Product\/WtooBrides\/14430\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Truly a &#039;fairytale&#039; bride feeling. I loved wearing this dress and the way that it photographed (It&#039;s also EXTREMELY slimming) - please note that my blush sash is not included.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":34733,"Name":"12418815_10153813335907930_2456501332138198886_o.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-51833200-1453063935.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-51833200-1453063935_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":960}],"Id":1909634,"PostDate":1453045972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm selling my Watters Gown (2015 design) which retails for $2000+ tax<br><br>\nI have had the dress professionally cleaned by a dry cleaner ($400) and the dress is in great condition (no tears or rips etc)<br><br>\nIt's a size 12 (Street size 10) and has had no alterations at all.<br><br>\nAsking $1200 obo<br><br>\nLocated in Toronto, but willing to ship if you pay for the shipping costs.<\/p>\n<p>**flowers removed from the back of the dress, but I did keep them in case someone would want them added back on**<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/watters.com\/Product\/WtooBrides\/14430\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/watters.com\/P...ooBrides\/14430\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Truly a 'fairytale' bride feeling. I loved wearing this dress and the way that it photographed (It's also EXTREMELY slimming) - please note that my blush sash is not included.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-93581600-1453064138.jpg\" title=\"10258101_10153813316942930_6964118223837943197_o.jpg -  61.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-93581600-1453064138.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10258101_10153813316942930_6964118223837943197_o.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-57826400-1453063888.jpg\" title=\"12418815_10153813335907930_2456501332138198886_o.jpg -  65.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-57826400-1453063888.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12418815_10153813335907930_2456501332138198886_o.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-58971300-1453063902.jpg\" title=\"10274074_10153813334612930_7868727484306645874_n.jpg -  58.25KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-58971300-1453063902.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10274074_10153813334612930_7868727484306645874_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-46439300-1453063911.jpg\" title=\"10371497_10153813323202930_4066995292758468540_n.jpg -  51.75KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-46439300-1453063911.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10371497_10153813323202930_4066995292758468540_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-87775500-1453063920.jpg\" title=\"10411353_10153813333647930_1356973297855140168_n.jpg -  79KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-281478-0-87775500-1453063920.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"10411353_10153813333647930_1356973297855140168_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1909634]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.