e you got your sash?","Attachments":[],"Id":1909636,"PostDate":1453050960,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Gorgeous! You'll sell it in no time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nPS. Can I ask where you got your sash?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Ashley<br><br>\nMy Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a> <br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/M+%26amp%3B+A+Wedding\/k\/d689\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\">","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423087061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.249.161.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1453053874,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e692dfe0eb682a376b56c2a300de48e","RawContent":"@[member=\"ashhtayy\"] I made the sash myself. I sewed an applique on to a grosgrain ribbon that I purchased","Attachments":[],"Id":1909640,"PostDate":1453053815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a> I made the sash myself. I sewed an applique on to a grosgrain ribbon that I purchased\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9667d820371327a428232a553ce3d32f","RawContent":"@[member=\"perianjay\"] I agree! You shouldn&#039;t have any trouble selling it! \n\n\nQuestion. You mentioned a FB site where you sold your other dress. Could you  pm me the link? I haven&#039;t had a single bite on the preownedweddingdresses.com site where I have my dress listed. Doug is getting a little upset by how much space the bags are taking up so I really need to try to get some stuff cleared away!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909675,"PostDate":1453111727,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> I agree! You shouldn't have any trouble selling it! <br><br>\nQuestion. You mentioned a FB site where you sold your other dress. Could you  pm me the link? I haven't had a single bite on the preownedweddingdresses.com site where I have my dress listed. Doug is getting a little upset by how much space the bags are taking up so I really need to try to get some stuff cleared away!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.142.4.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c7e6567b4d44895a3a40615e4376127","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[