\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; BOARDING PASS INVITATIONS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; BELLY BAND &amp;amp; MONOGRAM&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00078.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873544\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TICKET JACKET&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00088.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873547\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4 PAGE BOARDING PASS (WITH TEAR OFF RETURN TICKET)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"DSC00087.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873551\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;  &lt;img alt=\"DSC00089.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873557\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  CEREMONY PROGRAM FANS  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0683.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873565\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/&gt;  &amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  STARFISH PUNCH OUTS ON ZOT GLUE DOTS  &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0450.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873571\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1634278,"PostDate":1340393263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> With all the help and inspiration i got from everyone on here i figured it was only right that i share what i came up with.<\/p> <p> For boarding pass and ceremony fans i used aylee bit template\u00a0<\/p> <p> All clip art came from dafont.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> MATERIALS<\/p> <p> Envelope liners - wedding themed wrapping paper (walmart)<\/p> <p> Wrap around labels - ivory cardstock, stamp \u00a0(michaels)\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Boarding Passes - Metallic Cream Linen Cardstock (paperandmore)\u00a0<\/p> <p> Ticket Jackets and Ceremony Programs \u00a0- Metallic Lagoon Cardstock (paperandmore)<\/p> <p> Envelopes - Metallic Bronze #10 and Metallic Lagoon 4 bar (envelopemall)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <u>PIcked up at Michaels<\/u><\/p> <p> Rotary Trimmer<\/p> <p> 1\/8 Hole punch<\/p> <p> Sand Dollar\/Starfish Punch<\/p> <p> Rounded Corner Punch<\/p> <p> Scissors<\/p> <p> Zots glue dots<\/p> <p> Bone folder<\/p> <p> aqua ribbon<\/p> <p> Bronze brads<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> ENVELOPE LINERS AND WEDDING BROCHURE\u00a0<\/p> <p> magnet and carrier card ordered from magnetstreet<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03774.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873576\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> WRAP AROUND ADDRESS LABELS<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC03785.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873540\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00090.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873542\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> BOARDING PASS INVITATIONS<\/p> <p> BELLY BAND & MONOGRAM<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00078.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873544\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> TICKET JACKET<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00088.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873547\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 4 PAGE BOARDING PASS (WITH TEAR OFF RETURN TICKET)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00087.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873551\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00089.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873557\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>  \u00a0  \u00a0  CEREMONY PROGRAM FANS  \u00a0  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0683.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873565\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span>  \u00a0  \u00a0  STARFISH PUNCH OUTS ON ZOT GLUE DOTS  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0450.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873571\/width\/525\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chanteandrandall@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1300874834,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238077.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jazzysis","Id":238077,"Name":"jazzysis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68170,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08e85736e821b1228e1e51550bfdbb5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; those are so cute!!! you did a great job.&amp;nbsp;&